{"name":"Emptiness","hex":"#fcfdfc","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Emptiness","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A Chinese constellation near Aquarius and Equuleus, one of the 28 lunar mansions and part of the Black Turtle."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Emptiness"}],"entries":[{"title":"Emptiness","blocks":[{"text":"Emptiness as a human condition is a sense of generalized boredom, social alienation, nihilism, and apathy. Feelings of emptiness often accompany dysthymia, depression, loneliness, anhedonia,\ndespair, or other mental/emotional disorders, including schizoid personality disorder, post-traumatic stress disorder, attention deficit hyperactivity disorder, schizotypal personality disorder and borderline personality disorder. A sense of emptiness is also part of a natural process of grief, as resulting death of a loved one, or other significant changes. The particular meanings of \"emptiness\" vary with the particular context and the religious or cultural tradition in which it is used."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ad/Plate3empty.png/330px-Plate3empty.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emptiness"},{"title":"Emptiness (Chinese constellation)","blocks":[{"text":"The Emptiness mansion is one of the Twenty-eight mansions of the Chinese constellations. It is one of the northern mansions of the Black Tortoise."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/X%C5%ABXi%C3%B9.png/330px-X%C5%ABXi%C3%B9.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emptiness_(Chinese_constellation)"}],"images":[],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Strawberry on white background","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/Strawberry_on_white_background.jpg/500px-Strawberry_on_white_background.jpg","ratio":1.618,"